{"id":"b04e35d7c30c43b6","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-threshrecog.md","title":"Unit-margin linear-feasibility criterion","display":"thm-threshrecog — Unit-margin linear-feasibility criterion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-threshrecog","aliases":["27-thm-threshrecog"],"display":"thm-threshrecog — Unit-margin linear-feasibility criterion","depends_on":["[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.3 Theorem 9.13; local all-points unit-margin extension","source_printed_pages":"413–414","source_pdf_pages":"437–438","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-local-finite-margin-and-boundary-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-threshrecog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-threshrecog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-threshrecog — Unit-margin linear-feasibility criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.3 Theorem 9.13; local all-points unit-margin extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"413–414"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"437–438"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-local-finite-margin-and-boundary-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f),F(f)\">\\(T(f),F(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M(f),\\mathcal X(f),\\chi_A\">\\(\\mathcal M(f),\\mathcal X(f),\\chi_A\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i=1}^n w_ix_i\">\\(w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i=1}^n w_ix_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n=\\{w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(w_i\\geq0)\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n=\\{w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(w_i\\geq0)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left[\\forall x\\in T(f)\\;(w\\cdot x\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall y\\in F(f)\\;(w\\cdot y\\leq\\theta-1)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left[\\forall x\\in T(f)\\;(w\\cdot x\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall y\\in F(f)\\;(w\\cdot y\\leq\\theta-1)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;(w\\cdot\\chi_A\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal X(f)\\;(w\\cdot\\chi_{[n]\\setminus B}\\leq\\theta-1)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;(w\\cdot\\chi_A\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal X(f)\\;(w\\cdot\\chi_{[n]\\setminus B}\\leq\\theta-1)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §9.3，Theorem 9.13（印刷 pp.413–414／PDF pp.437–438）；已核对正函数的极小真点／极大假点系统和证明。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=t+1\">\\(\\theta=t+1\\)</span>，因而式子与原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\cdot Y\\geq t+1,w\\cdot X\\leq t\">\\(w\\cdot Y\\geq t+1,w\\cdot X\\leq t\\)</span> 一致。</li>\n<li>第一式是对所有真假点的本地推广：有限分离间隙可正比例放大至至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。正函数可取非负权，故只检查极小真点与极大假点已足够。常函数的一侧约束为空，仍可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=0\">\\(w=0\\)</span> 与适当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>输入明确为列举的真假点，或正函数的边界支持族；这里给可行性证书，不将该系统直接误称为任意公式编码上的多项式识别算法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$、$T(f),F(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$、$T(f),F(f)$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对 $f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 使用 $\\mathcal M(f),\\mathcal X(f),\\chi_A$，见 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。$w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i=1}^n w_ix_i$；$\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n=\\{w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(w_i\\geq0)\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T(f),F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M(f),\\mathcal X(f),\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i=1}^n w_ix_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n=\\{w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(w_i\\geq0)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists w\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left[\\forall x\\in T(f)\\;(w\\cdot x\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall y\\in F(f)\\;(w\\cdot y\\leq\\theta-1)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\;\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;(w\\cdot\\chi_A\\geq\\theta)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal X(f)\\;(w\\cdot\\chi_{[n]\\setminus B}\\leq\\theta-1)\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta=t+1","display":false},{"tex":"w\\cdot Y\\geq t+1,w\\cdot X\\leq t","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"w=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":2400,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-581","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-threshrecog|thm-threshrecog — Unit-margin linear-feasibility criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","d0db491e5f6359f5","a38b86e606184c7f"]}